      "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nAdds a new `^^chart` projector and supporting infrastructure so evaluated `Chart` ADT values can be rendered as D3-driven SVG charts in the web UI (optionally auto-displayed via a settings toggle).\n\n**Changes:**\n- Introduces built-in `Chart` ADT plus an OCaml-side recognizer (`ChartCore`) and a web projector (`ChartProj`) that delegates rendering to D3 in `prebundle.js`.\n- Adds a \u201cCharts\u201d toggle to evaluation settings and wires chart projection into pretty-printing/projector menus.\n- Adds chart styling (CSS vars + projector CSS), JS dependencies for D3 modules, and a native unit-test suite for chart recognition.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 32 out of 33 changed files in this pull request and generated 3 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| test/Test_PrettyPrint.re | Extends pretty-print settings with `project_charts`. |\r\n| test/Test_Menhir.re | Updates settings used in parser roundtrip tests with `project_charts`. |\r\n| test/Test_ExpToSegment.re | Updates multiple settings records to include `project_charts`. |\r\n| test/Test_DerivationCase.re | Updates pretty-print settings record to include `project_charts`. |\r\n| test/Test_ChartCore.re | Adds unit tests for `ChartCore.parse_chart`. |\r\n| test/Test_Abbreviate.re | Extends abbreviation settings with `project_charts`. |\r\n| test/haz3ltest.re | Registers `Test_ChartCore` in the test suite. |\r\n| src/web/www/style/variables.css | Adds chart-related CSS variables and series palette. |\r\n| src/web/www/style/projectors/proj-chart.css | Adds chart projector CSS for D3-rendered SVG. |\r\n| src/web/www/style/projectors/proj-base.css | Imports the new chart projector stylesheet. |\r\n| src/web/www/prebundle.js | Adds `window.HazelD3.render` and D3 rendering code for charts. |\r\n| src/web/view/NutMenu.re | Adds \u201cCharts\u201d toggle to the Value Display settings menu. |\r\n| src/web/view/Kind.re | Ensures kind/type views don\u2019t auto-project charts by default. |\r\n| src/web/view/ContextInspector.re | Ensures context inspector views don\u2019t auto-project charts by default. |\r\n| src/web/Settings.re | Adds `ProjectCharts` setting plumbing and default state. |\r\n| src/web/derivation/DrvCursorInspector.re | Adds `project_charts` to settings used in derivation inspector. |\r\n| src/web/app/sidebar/DebugSidebar.re | Adds `project_charts` to debug sidebar code-view settings. |\r\n| src/web/app/inspector/CursorInspector.re | Adds `project_charts` to cursor inspector code-view settings. |\r\n| src/web/app/explainthis/DrvDoc.re | Adds `project_charts` to ExplainThis doc rendering settings. |\r\n| src/web/app/editors/code/ContextMenu.re | Adds \u201cChart\u201d to projector kind label mapping for context menus. |\r\n| src/language/ProjectorKind.re | Registers `Chart` as a projector kind (`\"chart\"` / `^^chart`). |\r\n| src/language/CoreSettings.re | Adds `project_charts` to evaluation settings defaults. |\r\n| src/language/builtins/BuiltinsADT.re | Adds built-in `Chart` ADT type alias and constructors. |\r\n| src/haz3lcore/zipper/action/Introduce.re | Extends settings record with `project_charts`. |\r\n| src/haz3lcore/projectors/ProjectorInit.re | Registers `ChartProj` in projector initialization. |\r\n| src/haz3lcore/projectors/ProjectorInfo.re | Ensures projector utility settings include `project_charts`. |\r\n| src/haz3lcore/projectors/implementations/ChartProj.re | Implements the chart projector and D3 hook integration. |\r\n| src/haz3lcore/projectors/implementations/ChartCore.rei | Declares `ChartCore` types and `parse_chart` API. |\r\n| src/haz3lcore/projectors/implementations/ChartCore.re | Implements chart recognition/parsing from elaborated syntax. |\r\n| src/haz3lcore/pretty/ExpToSegment.re | Adds chart auto-projection gating and setting support. |\r\n| src/CLI/Print.re | Extends CLI printing settings with `project_charts`. |\r\n| package.json | Adds D3 module dependencies needed by `prebundle.js`. |\r\n| package-lock.json | Locks the added D3 dependencies and transitive deps. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n\ud83d\udca1 <a href=\"/hazelgrove/hazel/new/dev?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
